#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:3
msgid "phpBB Skeleton Extension"
msgstr "phpBB Skeleton Extension"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension is a tool for extension developers. Its purpose is to"
" kick start your extension development projects."
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension er et værktøj til udvidelsesudviklere. Dens formål er at "
"give dine udvidelsesudviklingsprojekter en hurtig start."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:8
msgid ""
"What is a skeleton? It's a working boiler-plate extension. When you want to "
"begin development on an extension, creating a skeleton will generate most of"
" the initial files you would need, so you don't have to."
msgstr ""
"Hvad er et skeleton? Det er en fungerende skabelonudvidelse (boiler-plate). "
"Når du vil begynde udvikling af en udvidelse, vil oprettelse af et skeleton "
"generere de fleste af de indledende filer, du ville have brug for, så du "
"slipper for det."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:13
msgid ""
"This means you can jump straight into writing code for your extension, and "
"bypass the mundane task of creating the initial files, methods and docblocks"
" yourself."
msgstr ""
"Dette betyder, at du kan springe direkte til at skrive kode til din "
"udvidelse og springe den trivielle opgave over med selv at oprette de "
"indledende filer, metoder og docblocks."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you've never written an extension before, a skeleton provides an ideal "
"way to get started with your first one. Experienced developers will love it "
"too, no longer having to copy-paste code from their existing extensions in "
"order to start up new ones."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du aldrig har skrevet en udvidelse før, giver et skeleton en ideel måde"
" at komme i gang med din første. Erfarne udviklere vil også elske det, da de"
" ikke længere skal copy-paste kode fra deres eksisterende udvidelser for at "
"starte nye."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:22
msgid ""
"All code generated by the Skeleton Extension is fully documented and "
"represents the phpBB Extension Team's best practices for extension coding."
msgstr ""
"Al kode, der genereres af Skeleton Extension, er fuldt dokumenteret og "
"repræsenterer phpBB's Extension Teams best practices for udvidelseskodning."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:25
msgid ""
"Be sure to reference and familiarise yourself with phpBB's `extension "
"validation policies <https://www.phpbb.com/extensions/rules-and-"
"policies/validation-policy/>`_ and `coding guidelines "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/development/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for at henvise til og gøre dig fortrolig med phpBB's "
"`valideringspolitikker for udvidelser "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/extensions/rules-and-policies/validation-policy/>`_ "
"og `kodningsretningslinjer "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/development/index.html>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:30
msgid "How to install"
msgstr "Sådan installeres det"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:32
msgid ""
"phpBB's Skeleton Extension is just like any other extension and is installed"
" into a phpBB board just the same as any other."
msgstr ""
"phpBB's Skeleton Extension er ligesom enhver anden udvidelse og installeres "
"i et phpBB-forum på præcis samme måde som enhver anden."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:37
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension is intended to be installed in a phpBB board used for"
" offline/local development of extensions. It is not necessarily intended to "
"be installed on live/production web sites."
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension er beregnet til at blive installeret på et phpBB-forum, "
"der bruges til offline/lokal udvikling af udvidelser. Det er ikke "
"nødvendigvis beregnet til at blive installeret på live/produktions-websites."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:43
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:45
msgid ""
"`Download the latest release "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/customise/db/official_tool/ext_skeleton/>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Download den nyeste udgivelse "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/customise/db/official_tool/ext_skeleton/>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:47
msgid ""
"Unzip and install it to your phpBB ``ext/`` folder, e.g. "
"``phpBB/ext/phpbb/skeleton``"
msgstr ""
"Udpak den, og installer den i din phpBB-mappe ``ext/``, f.eks. "
"``phpBB/ext/phpbb/skeleton``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:49
msgid ""
"In phpBB, go to \"ACP\" > \"Customise\" > \"Extensions\" and enable \"phpBB "
"Skeleton Extension\"."
msgstr ""
"Gå i phpBB til \"ACP\" > \"Customise\" > \"Extensions\", og aktivér \"phpBB "
"Skeleton Extension\"."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:53
msgid "Create an extension"
msgstr "Oprettelse af en udvidelse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:57
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension generates working classes and methods which are "
"intended to make the skeleton nominally functional and, more importantly, "
"instructional."
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer fungerende klasser og metoder, der er beregnet "
"til at gøre skelettet nominelt funktionelt og, endnu vigtigere, instruktivt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:61
msgid ""
"This documentation will assume we are creating the Acme Demo extension, with"
" the vendor/package naming structure: ``acme/demo``. Most file, function, "
"class, table and variable names will be populated with the vendor and "
"package names specified."
msgstr ""
"Denne dokumentation forudsætter, at vi opretter Acme Demo-udvidelsen med "
"vendor/pakke-navngivningsstrukturen: ``acme/demo``. De fleste fil-, "
"funktions-, klasse-, tabel- og variabelnavne udfyldes med de angivne vendor-"
" og pakkenavne."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:66
msgid ""
"The skeleton generated is only a starting point! You should always review "
"the skeleton code you generate and update, edit or remove any of the code "
"you do not need as you begin to develop your extension."
msgstr ""
"Det genererede skeleton er kun et udgangspunkt! Du bør altid gennemgå den "
"genererede skeleton-kode og opdatere, redigere eller fjerne den kode, du "
"ikke har brug for, når du begynder at udvikle din udvidelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:71
msgid "phpBB Web interface"
msgstr "phpBB webinterface"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:73
msgid ""
"The easiest way to use the Skeleton Extension is from its web-based user "
"interface (UI)."
msgstr ""
"Den nemmeste måde at bruge Skeleton Extension på er fra dens webbaserede "
"brugerinterface (UI)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:79
msgid ""
"In order to create an extension via the web UI, open the phpBB board you "
"installed this extension in and visit the \"Create skeleton extension\" link"
" in the board's navigation bar."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en udvidelse via webinterfacet skal du åbne det phpBB-forum, "
"du installerede denne udvidelse i, og besøge linket \"Create skeleton "
"extension\" i forummets navigationslinje."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:83
msgid ""
"You will be presented with a form where you can enter information about the "
"extension you want to create. Complete the form and submit it."
msgstr ""
"Du vil blive præsenteret for en formular, hvor du kan indtaste oplysninger "
"om den udvidelse, du vil oprette. Udfyld formularen, og indsend den."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:86
msgid ""
"A packaged ZIP file will begin to download in your browser. Additionally, a "
"copy of it can be found in ``phpBB/store/tmp-ext/``."
msgstr ""
"En pakket ZIP-fil begynder at downloade i din browser. Derudover kan en kopi"
" af den findes i ``phpBB/store/tmp-ext/``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:89
msgid "Unzip your skeleton extension and begin writing your own code."
msgstr "Udpak din skeleton-udvidelse, og begynd at skrive din egen kode."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:92
msgid "Command line interface"
msgstr "Kommandolinjeinterface"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:94
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension can also accommodate users that prefer working from a"
" Command Line Interface (CLI)."
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension kan også imødekomme brugere, der foretrækker at arbejde "
"fra et kommandolinjeinterface (CLI)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:100
msgid ""
"In order to create an extension via the CLI, you need to open a console on "
"your server and ``cd`` to the root directory of the phpBB board where you "
"installed this extension:"
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en udvidelse via CLI'en skal du åbne en konsol på din server "
"og bruge ``cd`` til at gå til rodmappen for det phpBB-forum, hvor du "
"installerede denne udvidelse:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:108
msgid "To create an extension, run:"
msgstr "For at oprette en udvidelse skal du køre:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:114
msgid ""
"You will be prompted to enter information about the extension you want to "
"create."
msgstr ""
"Du bliver bedt om at indtaste oplysninger om den udvidelse, du vil oprette."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:117
msgid "Your extension will be saved to ``phpBB/store/tmp-ext/``."
msgstr "Din udvidelse gemmes i ``phpBB/store/tmp-ext/``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:120
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentation"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:122
msgid ""
"The following documentation describes how to use the Skeleton Extension to "
"configure and generate a skeleton that will suit your needs, so you can jump"
" straight into writing your own code."
msgstr ""
"Følgende dokumentation beskriver, hvordan man bruger Skeleton Extension til "
"at konfigurere og generere et skeleton, der passer til dine behov, så du kan"
" springe direkte til at skrive din egen kode."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:127
msgid "Extension packaging"
msgstr "Udvidelsespakning"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:129
msgid ""
"Extensions are packaged in a directory structure as follows: "
"``vendorname/extensionname``. For example, the Acme Demo extension uses a "
"packaging structure that looks like ``acme/demo``."
msgstr ""
"Udvidelser pakkes i en mappestruktur som følger: "
"``vendorname/extensionname``. F.eks. bruger Acme Demo-udvidelsen en "
"pakningsstruktur, der ser sådan ud: ``acme/demo``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:133
msgid "Vendor name"
msgstr "Vendor-navn"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:135
msgid ""
"The vendor name can be your username or any other name you choose to "
"associate your extensions with. Valid naming conventions must start with a "
"letter and contain letters and numbers only. In the case of the Acme Demo "
"extension, this would be ``acme``. **This field is required.**"
msgstr ""
"Vendor-navnet kan være dit brugernavn eller et hvilket som helst andet navn,"
" du vælger at knytte dine udvidelser til. Gyldige navngivningskonventioner "
"skal starte med et bogstav og kun indeholde bogstaver og tal. I tilfældet "
"med Acme Demo-udvidelsen ville dette være ``acme``. **Dette felt er "
"påkrævet.**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:141
msgid "Package name"
msgstr "Pakkenavn"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:143
msgid ""
"The package name is the name of the extension. Valid naming conventions must"
" start with a letter and contain letters and numbers only. In the case of "
"the Acme Demo extension, this would be ``demo``. **This field is required.**"
msgstr ""
"Pakkenavnet er navnet på udvidelsen. Gyldige navngivningskonventioner skal "
"starte med et bogstav og kun indeholde bogstaver og tal. I tilfældet med "
"Acme Demo-udvidelsen ville dette være ``demo``. **Dette felt er påkrævet.**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:148
msgid "Display name"
msgstr "Visningsnavn"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:150
msgid ""
"This is the name (or title) of your extension in plain English. This is what"
" the user will see when your extension appears in the phpBB ACP Extension "
"Manager. In the case of the Acme Demo extension, this would be ``Acme "
"Demo``. **This field is required.**"
msgstr ""
"Dette er navnet (eller titlen) på din udvidelse i almindeligt sprog. Dette "
"er det, brugeren vil se, når din udvidelse vises i phpBB's ACP Extension "
"Manager. I tilfældet med Acme Demo-udvidelsen ville dette være ``Acme "
"Demo``. **Dette felt er påkrævet.**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:155
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrivelse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:157
msgid ""
"A brief description of your extension. This will be visible to users in the "
"Details page of your extension in phpBB's ACP Extension Manager."
msgstr ""
"En kort beskrivelse af din udvidelse. Denne vil være synlig for brugere på "
"detaljesiden for din udvidelse i phpBB's ACP Extension Manager."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:161
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:163
msgid ""
"The version of your extension. phpBB's coding guidelines require an "
"``x.y.z`` semantic versioning format, with optional ``-dev``, ``-alpha``, "
"``-beta`` and ``-RC`` pre-release suffixes. When left blank, the Skeleton "
"Extension will use ``1.0.0-dev`` by default."
msgstr ""
"Din udvidelses version. phpBB's kodningsretningslinjer kræver et semantisk "
"versionsformat ``x.y.z`` med valgfrie pre-release-suffikser ``-dev``, "
"``-alpha``, ``-beta`` og ``-RC``. Hvis feltet efterlades tomt, bruger "
"Skeleton Extension som standard ``1.0.0-dev``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:168
msgid "Date of the extension"
msgstr "Dato for udvidelsen"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:170
msgid ""
"Date the extension is released. Dates must be in the ``YYYY-MM-DD`` format. "
"When left blank, the Skeleton Extension will use the current date by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Datoen, hvor udvidelsen udgives. Datoer skal være i formatet ``YYYY-MM-DD``."
" Hvis feltet efterlades tomt, bruger Skeleton Extension som standard den "
"aktuelle dato."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:174
msgid "Homepage of the extension"
msgstr "Hjemmeside for udvidelsen"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:176
msgid ""
"An optional link to your extension's homepage. This can be, for example, an "
"extension's GitHub repository or any other site related to your extension."
msgstr ""
"Et valgfrit link til din udvidelses hjemmeside. Dette kan f.eks. være en "
"udvidelses GitHub-repository eller et hvilket som helst andet site relateret"
" til din udvidelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:180
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Forfattere"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:182
msgid ""
"Here you can name your extension's author(s). Use the ``Add author`` button "
"to add additional authors."
msgstr ""
"Her kan du navngive din udvidelses forfatter(e). Brug knappen ``Add author``"
" til at tilføje yderligere forfattere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:186
msgid "Author name"
msgstr "Forfatternavn"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:188
msgid "The name of an extension's author. Must not be empty."
msgstr "Navnet på en udvidelses forfatter. Må ikke være tomt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:191
msgid "Author email"
msgstr "Forfatterens e-mail"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:193
msgid "The email address of an extension's author. (Optional)"
msgstr "E-mailadressen for en udvidelses forfatter. (Valgfrit)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:196
msgid "Author homepage"
msgstr "Forfatterens hjemmeside"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:198
msgid "The homepage URL of an extension's author. (Optional)"
msgstr "URL'en til hjemmesiden for en udvidelses forfatter. (Valgfrit)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:201
msgid "Author role"
msgstr "Forfatterens rolle"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:203
msgid ""
"The role of an extension's author. For example, lead developer, contributor,"
" translator, etc. (Optional)"
msgstr ""
"Rollen for en udvidelses forfatter. F.eks. lead developer, bidragyder, "
"oversætter osv. (Valgfrit)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:207
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Krav"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:209
msgid ""
"Requirements are where you define the minimum (and maximum) PHP and phpBB "
"versions your extension needs to be able to perform."
msgstr ""
"Krav er der, hvor du definerer de mindste (og højeste) PHP- og phpBB-"
"versioner, din udvidelse har brug for for at kunne fungere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:213
msgid "Minimum phpBB requirement of the extension"
msgstr "Udvidelsens mindste phpBB-krav"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:215
msgid ""
"Typically this should be set to the version of phpBB in which you are "
"developing and testing your extension."
msgstr ""
"Typisk bør dette sættes til den version af phpBB, som du udvikler og tester "
"din udvidelse i."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:218
msgid ""
"The version should be defined using `Composer's version constraints "
"<https://getcomposer.org/doc/articles/versions.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"Versionen bør defineres ved hjælp af `Composers versionsbegrænsninger "
"<https://getcomposer.org/doc/articles/versions.md>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:221
msgid "For example, to require phpBB 3.1.4 or greater, use ``>=3.1.4``."
msgstr "For f.eks. at kræve phpBB 3.1.4 eller nyere, brug ``>=3.1.4``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:224
msgid "Maximum phpBB requirement of the extension"
msgstr "Udvidelsens højeste phpBB-krav"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:226
msgid ""
"To mitigate compatibility breaks, it is common to set the maximum version to"
" the next major release version of phpBB."
msgstr ""
"For at afbøde kompatibilitetsbrud er det almindeligt at sætte "
"maksimumsversionen til den næste hovedversion af phpBB."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:229
msgid ""
"For example, if your extension is being developed for phpBB 3.1.x, you can "
"set the maximum requirement to phpBB 3.2.x by using ``<3.2.0@dev``."
msgstr ""
"Hvis din udvidelse f.eks. udvikles til phpBB 3.1.x, kan du sætte "
"maksimumskravet til phpBB 3.2.x ved at bruge ``<3.2.0@dev``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:234
msgid ""
"Currently, phpBB does not automatically enforce the minimum and maximum "
"requirements. However, it will begin enforcing it in a future release. In "
"the meantime, it is possible to use the ``is_enableable()`` method in the "
"``ext.php`` class to `enforce the minimum and maximum requirements "
"<https://github.com/phpbb-"
"extensions/boardrules/blob/master/ext.php#L29-L43>`_."
msgstr ""
"I øjeblikket håndhæver phpBB ikke automatisk de mindste og højeste krav. Det"
" vil dog begynde at håndhæve det i en fremtidig udgivelse. I mellemtiden er "
"det muligt at bruge metoden ``is_enableable()`` i klassen ``ext.php`` til at"
" `håndhæve de mindste og højeste krav <https://github.com/phpbb-"
"extensions/boardrules/blob/master/ext.php#L29-L43>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:241
msgid "PHP requirement of the extension"
msgstr "Udvidelsens PHP-krav"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:243
msgid ""
"Since your extension will operate within phpBB, it's often safe to assume "
"that your extension will share the same minimum PHP requirement as phpBB "
"does. Thus, by default, this field will use ``>=5.3.3`` unless you enter an "
"alternative version."
msgstr ""
"Da din udvidelse vil operere inden for phpBB, er det ofte sikkert at antage,"
" at din udvidelse deler det samme mindste PHP-krav som phpBB. Derfor bruger "
"dette felt som standard ``>=5.3.3``, medmindre du angiver en alternativ "
"version."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:250
msgid ""
"You can find phpBB's PHP requirements by looking at its composer.json file."
msgstr "Du kan finde phpBB's PHP-krav ved at kigge på dens composer.json-fil."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:253
msgid "Components"
msgstr "Komponenter"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:255
msgid ""
"The default Skeleton Extension outputs a license file and composer.json. The"
" Components section allows you to choose from a variety of typical "
"components an extension could need, such as an ACP module, migrations, "
"events, and tasks such as cron, CLI and notifications. The files generated "
"for these components are simple yet fully working examples based off the "
"Acme Demo extension. They are intended to give you a consistent and phpBB "
"code-ready starting point, so you can focus more on writing your code and "
"less on file structure and organisation."
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer som standard en licensfil og composer.json. "
"Sektionen Komponenter giver dig mulighed for at vælge blandt en række "
"typiske komponenter, en udvidelse kunne have brug for, såsom et ACP-modul, "
"migreringer, events og opgaver som cron, CLI og notifikationer. De filer, "
"der genereres til disse komponenter, er simple, men fuldt fungerende "
"eksempler baseret på Acme Demo-udvidelsen. De er beregnet til at give dig et"
" konsistent og phpBB-kodeklart udgangspunkt, så du kan fokusere mere på at "
"skrive din kode og mindre på filstruktur og organisering."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:265
msgid "PHP event listeners"
msgstr "PHP-event-listeners"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:267
msgid ""
"PHP event listeners work with core events to inject code into phpBB. Core "
"events are like hooks, and they can be found throughout phpBB's codebase at "
"key points. They give your extension access to phpBB's variables and allow "
"you to use and modify them or to inject additional PHP code during phpBB's "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"PHP-event-listeners arbejder sammen med kerne-events for at injicere kode i "
"phpBB. Kerne-events er som hooks og findes i hele phpBB's kodebase på "
"nøglepunkter. De giver din udvidelse adgang til phpBB's variabler og lader "
"dig bruge og ændre dem eller injicere yderligere PHP-kode under phpBB's "
"eksekvering."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:273
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a sample event listener PHP file and "
"necessary services YAML file:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en eksempel-PHP-fil til en event-listener og "
"den nødvendige services-YAML-fil:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:290
msgid "Style event listeners"
msgstr "Style-event-listeners"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:292
msgid ""
"Style listeners use template events to inject HTML, JS and CSS into phpBB’s "
"style files. Style listeners must be located in a directory named ``event`` "
"to be recognised as a template event. All files outside the ``event`` dir "
"are seen as standard style files."
msgstr ""
"Style-listeners bruger modelevents til at injicere HTML, JS og CSS i phpBB's"
" style-filer. Style-listeners skal være placeret i en mappe ved navn "
"``event`` for at blive genkendt som et modelevent. Alle filer uden for "
"``event``-mappen betragtes som almindelige style-filer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:297
msgid ""
"``all/`` Directory contains style files that can be used by any/all styles."
msgstr ""
"Mappen ``all/`` indeholder style-filer, der kan bruges af alle styles."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:300
msgid ""
"``prosilver/`` Directory contains style files specifically for prosilver "
"(and any styles that inherit from prosilver)."
msgstr ""
"Mappen ``prosilver/`` indeholder style-filer specifikt til prosilver (og "
"alle styles, der arver fra prosilver)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:303
msgid ""
"``subsilver2/`` Directory contains style files specifically for subsilver2 "
"(and any styles that inherit from subsilver2)."
msgstr ""
"Mappen ``subsilver2/`` indeholder style-filer specifikt til subsilver2 (og "
"alle styles, der arver fra subsilver2)."

