#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:456
msgid "Database migration"
msgstr "Databasemigrering"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:458
msgid ""
"Migration files are used to make database changes. This includes adding data"
" to tables and schema changes (which are changes to the database's tables "
"and columns)."
msgstr ""
"Migreringsfiler bruges til at foretage databaseændringer. Dette omfatter "
"tilføjelse af data til tabeller og skemaændringer (som er ændringer i "
"databasens tabeller og kolonner)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:462
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate all of its sample migration files:"
msgstr "Skeleton Extension genererer alle sine eksempel-migreringsfiler:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:479
msgid "Service"
msgstr "Service"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:481
msgid ""
"The Service component is a PHP class that does something behind the scenes. "
"It is a class that can be accessed by controllers, event listeners, or "
"control panel modules."
msgstr ""
"Service-komponenten er en PHP-klasse, der gør noget bag kulissen. Det er en "
"klasse, der kan tilgås af controllere, event-listeners eller "
"kontrolpanelmoduler."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:485
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a sample class that simply returns the "
"current user object. It shows how to use dependency injection for services "
"and parameters, thus it includes sample config and parameter YAML files:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en eksempelklasse, der blot returnerer det "
"aktuelle brugerobjekt. Den viser, hvordan man bruger dependency injection "
"til services og parametre, og indeholder derfor eksempel-config- og "
"parameter-YAML-filer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:503
msgid "Controller (front page)"
msgstr "Controller (frontside)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:505
msgid ""
"Controllers are typically used for front-facing files/classes. They run the "
"code that produces a new and complete page that the user will interact with."
" Examples of front-facing pages an extension may use include a news page, a "
"blog, a FAQ, etc."
msgstr ""
"Controllere bruges typisk til front-facing filer/klasser. De kører koden, "
"der producerer en ny og komplet side, som brugeren vil interagere med. "
"Eksempler på front-facing sider, en udvidelse kan bruge, inkluderer en "
"nyhedsside, en blog, en FAQ osv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:510
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension generates a front-facing page that displays a \"Hello"
" world\" message to the user. Included with this component are the HTML "
"template file for the page, PHP and template event listeners (to demonstrate"
" adding a link to the new page in the nav bar), the language file, and the "
"config and routing YAML files:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en front-facing side, der viser en \"Hello "
"world\"-besked til brugeren. Inkluderet i denne komponent er HTML-modelfilen"
" til siden, PHP- og modelevent-listeners (for at demonstrere tilføjelse af "
"et link til den nye side i navigationslinjen), sprogfilen samt config- og "
"routing-YAML-filerne:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:549
msgid "Extension base (ext.php)"
msgstr "Udvidelsesbase (ext.php)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:551
msgid ""
"The optional ``ext.php`` file can be used to run code before or during "
"extension installation and removal operations. This is most useful if your "
"extension needs to run code when it is enabled, disabled, or purged. "
"Extensions have also used it to check if phpBB satisfies the requirements of"
" the extension before proceeding with installation, to define class "
"constants, and more."
msgstr ""
"Den valgfrie fil ``ext.php`` kan bruges til at køre kode før eller under "
"installations- og fjernelsesoperationer for udvidelsen. Dette er mest "
"nyttigt, hvis din udvidelse skal køre kode, når den aktiveres, deaktiveres "
"eller purges. Udvidelser har også brugt den til at kontrollere, om phpBB "
"opfylder udvidelsens krav, før installationen fortsætter, til at definere "
"klassekonstanter og mere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:558
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a sample ``ext.php`` class. This class "
"is empty by default but can be populated with methods when used with other "
"components (such as Notifications):"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en eksempelklasse ``ext.php``. Denne klasse er "
"tom som standard, men kan udfyldes med metoder, når den bruges sammen med "
"andre komponenter (såsom Notifications):"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:571
msgid "Console command"
msgstr "Konsolkommando"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:573
msgid ""
"Extensions can add their own commands to phpBB's command line interface "
"(CLI). This is useful for extension that can provide additional terminal "
"commands to perform certain actions."
msgstr ""
"Udvidelser kan tilføje deres egne kommandoer til phpBB's "
"kommandolinjeinterface (CLI). Dette er nyttigt for udvidelser, der kan "
"tilbyde yderligere terminalkommandoer til at udføre bestemte handlinger."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:577
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a simple CLI command, including the "
"necessary language and config files:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en simpel CLI-kommando, inklusive de nødvendige"
" sprog- og config-filer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:601
msgid "Cron task"
msgstr "Cron-task"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:603
msgid ""
"A cron task allows an extension to schedule and run actions at specific time"
" intervals."
msgstr ""
"En cron-task giver en udvidelse mulighed for at planlægge og køre handlinger"
" med bestemte tidsintervaller."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:606
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a simple cron task, including the "
"necessary migration and config files:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en simpel cron-task, inklusive de nødvendige "
"migrerings- og config-filer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:628
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifikationer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:630
msgid ""
"Notifications allow an extension to notify users of specific activities "
"through phpBB's notification system."
msgstr ""
"Notifikationer giver en udvidelse mulighed for at give brugerne besked om "
"specifikke aktiviteter gennem phpBB's notifikationssystem."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:633
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a sample notification, including the "
"necessary language and config files. Additionally it will generate an "
"``ext.php`` file with important actions that must run during an extension's "
"enable, disable and purge steps:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en eksempelnotifikation, inklusive de "
"nødvendige sprog- og config-filer. Derudover genererer den en fil "
"``ext.php`` med vigtige handlinger, der skal køres under en udvidelses "
"aktiverings-, deaktiverings- og purge-trin:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:661
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Tilladelser"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:663
msgid ""
"Permissions can be used to grant users, groups and roles access to specific "
"extension features and functionality."
msgstr ""
"Tilladelser kan bruges til at give brugere, grupper og roller adgang til "
"specifikke funktioner og funktionalitet i udvidelsen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:666
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate a migration file showing the "
"installation of admin, moderator and user level permissions and assign then "
"to some roles and user groups. Additionally, the required permissions "
"language file is created as well as a PHP event that shows how permissions "
"are assigned to their respective language keys and permission categories:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer en migreringsfil, der viser installationen af "
"tilladelser på admin-, moderator- og brugerniveau og tildeler dem til nogle "
"roller og brugergrupper. Derudover oprettes den nødvendige sprogfil til "
"tilladelser samt et PHP-event, der viser, hvordan tilladelser tildeles deres"
" respektive sprognøgler og tilladelseskategorier:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:695
msgid "Tests (PHPUnit)"
msgstr "Tests (PHPUnit)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:697
msgid ""
"Unit tests can test an extension to verify that specific portions of its "
"source code work properly. This helps ensure basic code integrity and "
"prevents regressions as an extension is being developed and debugged."
msgstr ""
"Unit tests kan teste en udvidelse for at verificere, at specifikke dele af "
"dens kildekode fungerer korrekt. Dette hjælper med at sikre grundlæggende "
"kodeintegritet og forhindrer regressioner, mens en udvidelse udvikles og "
"fejlrettes."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:701
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension will generate some basic sample unit and functional "
"tests:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension genererer nogle grundlæggende eksempler på unit- og "
"funktionelle tests:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:727
msgid "GitHub Actions CI configuration"
msgstr "GitHub Actions CI-konfiguration"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:729
msgid ""
"GitHub Actions provides a platform to automatically run your PHPUnit tests "
"on each commit and pull request in your repository."
msgstr ""
"GitHub Actions tilbyder en platform til automatisk at køre dine PHPUnit-"
"tests ved hver commit og pull request i dit repository."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:732
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Extension can generate two types of workflow scripts based on "
"your needs:"
msgstr ""
"Skeleton Extension kan generere to typer workflow-scripts baseret på dine "
"behov:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:734
msgid "**GitHub Actions workflow (default):**"
msgstr "**GitHub Actions-workflow (standard):**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:735
msgid ""
"Generates a simplified, reusable workflow containing a few adjustable "
"variables. You can easily enable or disable the types of tests you want to "
"run. This workflow is maintained by phpBB and is designed to test your "
"extension against all the same PHP versions and databases supported by "
"phpBB."
msgstr ""
"Genererer en forenklet, genanvendelig workflow, der indeholder nogle få "
"justerbare variabler. Du kan nemt aktivere eller deaktivere de typer tests, "
"du vil køre. Denne workflow vedligeholdes af phpBB og er designet til at "
"teste din udvidelse mod alle de samme PHP-versioner og databaser, som phpBB "
"understøtter."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:737
msgid "**GitHub Actions custom workflow (optional):**"
msgstr "**Brugerdefineret GitHub Actions-workflow (valgfrit):**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:738
msgid ""
"Generates a fully editable, self-contained workflow for your repository. "
"This option gives you complete control over the jobs and steps, making it "
"ideal if you plan to customise or extend the testing process."
msgstr ""
"Genererer en fuldt redigerbar, selvstændig workflow til dit repository. "
"Denne mulighed giver dig fuld kontrol over jobs og trin, hvilket gør den "
"ideel, hvis du planlægger at tilpasse eller udvide testprocessen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:754
msgid ""
"The ``.github`` directory is a hidden folder. You can view and access it "
"using a Text Editor or IDE that is capable of displaying hidden folders."
msgstr ""
"Mappen ``.github`` er en skjult mappe. Du kan se og tilgå den ved hjælp af "
"en teksteditor eller IDE, der er i stand til at vise skjulte mapper."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:758
msgid "Build script (phing)"
msgstr "Build-script (phing)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:760
msgid ""
"A phing build script is generated for your extension which can be used to "
"generate build packages to help simplify the release or deployment process."
msgstr ""
"Et phing-build-script genereres til din udvidelse, som kan bruges til at "
"generere build-pakker for at hjælpe med at forenkle udgivelses- eller "
"deployment-processen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:764
msgid ""
"For example, when you are ready to release a version of your extension, "
"running the build script will package your extension in the appropriate "
"vendor/package format and generate a ZIP file ready to submit to phpBB's "
"Customisation Database. It can also clean out files not intended for "
"distribution such as unit tests and hidden Git files."
msgstr ""
"Når du f.eks. er klar til at udgive en version af din udvidelse, vil kørsel "
"af build-scriptet pakke din udvidelse i det passende vendor/pakke-format og "
"generere en ZIP-fil, klar til at blive indsendt til phpBB's Customisation "
"Database. Det kan også rydde op i filer, der ikke er beregnet til "
"distribution, såsom unit tests og skjulte Git-filer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:770
msgid "To run the build script, use the following console commands:"
msgstr "For at køre build-scriptet skal du bruge følgende konsolkommandoer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:783
msgid ""
"After phing successfully completes its process, a ``build`` folder will be "
"added to your repository:"
msgstr ""
"Når phing med succes har fuldført sin proces, tilføjes en mappe ``build`` "
"til dit repository:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/skeleton_extension.rst:801
msgid ""
"Never commit the build directory to Git or your repository. You should add "
"``build/`` to your ``.gitignore`` to ensure Git ignores this directory."
msgstr ""
"Commit aldrig build-mappen til Git eller dit repository. Du bør tilføje "
"``build/`` til din ``.gitignore`` for at sikre, at Git ignorerer denne "
"mappe."
